Rebuild a disposable extracted copy; the builders overwrite derived outputs and
some manifest review labels. From this pack root run:
  python source/build_mechanisms.py --stills-only
  python source/package_proof.py
Omit --stills-only to rebuild the full existing animation set. Python, Pillow and
NumPy are required; review movies need FFmpeg with libx264. Pillow >=10.1 is
recommended for size-aware font fallback. Font labels prefer installed DejaVu
Sans; set LANTERN_FONT_PATH to any suitable font file, or 'default' for Pillow's
bundled font. Fallback typography can differ; source art is unaffected.
See SOURCE_PORTABILITY.json for the bounded replay and byte-preservation scope.
